{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your empty patio into a vibrant, cat-filled catio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 100+ items, and build elaborate custom cat trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d98badab19763b8d8e25c2ce5f6ccec0.poster.avif?t=1768742879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d98badab19763b8d8e25c2ce5f6ccec0.webm?t=1768742879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d98badab19763b8d8e25c2ce5f6ccec0.mp4?t=1768742879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Cats Get Adopted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet your cats to prepare them for adoption. Once they're ready, adopt them out and collect their adoption fees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.poster.avif?t=1768742879\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.webm?t=1768742879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/3743c693d00b4cccc177d6070c34f34e.mp4?t=1768742879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Petting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate and improve your petting with a variety of upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s